Subject: [PATCH 04/13] FeatureGate: feature catalog and rule validation

- FeatureCatalog: only known feature IDs (camera, nav_*, notification_shade,
  hotspot, wifi, mobile_data) and app:<installed package> are accepted;
  unknown IDs throw ServiceSpecificException(ERROR_UNKNOWN_FEATURE).
- Package lookup runs with cleared calling identity, outside the service lock.
- AIDL: getSupportedFeatures() appended at the end (existing codes unchanged).
- Manager: feature constants, getSupportedFeatures(), translates the error
  code into IllegalArgumentException.
- cmd feature_gate features.

Change-Id: Id9952155674c5986d2549c7ec7d61874c2ce92af
